  "body": "Settle down here. Urgent sale Develop subdivision build new house, planner said 2-3 free standing houses site, maybe more if terrace housed. Settle down here near beach lifetime enjoyment. \r\n\r\nLocate at high side of the street, half section plaster house crosslease sold more than $1.2m, half section 2 bedroom only low side street sold $1.2m, people love tbus street quiet yet close to beach \r\n\r\nPrivate sale simple direct tell your lawyer get it done. Please communicate we will send you town planner subdivision report.\r\n\r\nViewing any time,  flatmates always here, no appointment needed. \r\n\r\nAll agents welcome.\r\n\r\n#68 hebron rd, half section 10y new home sold $1.89m. People settle down here raise family to retirement by the beach! \r\n\r\nWalk to beach nice street, full section, weatherboard house 607m2, elevated wide road frontage. Renovated kitchen,  do up house or develope \r\n\r\nHouse on the left, section on the right.\r\n\r\n3 bedroom upstairs, rumpus room downstairs.\r\n\r\nPossible 2-3 free stand home sites, wide road frontage. Or terrace, plan change 120 to Urban zone, #68 hebron and many houses in the street are 3 storey. Tell me what you want, i can recommend other land choice.",
